  "description": "Introducing the all-new WIRED Viper - our most innovative dual motor e-bike with UL2271 certified batteries! Featuring a compact 20\" x 4\" tire design with the convenience of a step-thru frame, the Viper is perfect for riders seeking power, accessibility, and safety.\n\nThe Viper is the first bike in our lineup to feature integrated turn signals for enhanced safety and visibility on every ride.\n\n8000W Peak Power: Geared front and rear motors deliver incredible acceleration\n\n430 N.m Combined Torque: Our most powerful torque output - conquers any terrain\n\n20\" x 4\" Fat Tires: Compact, agile wheels for superior maneuverability\n\nPerfect For\n\nWhether you're commuting through city streets, exploring off-road trails, or need a powerful bike that's easy to mount and maneuver, the Viper delivers unmatched performance in a rider-friendly package with UL2271 certified battery safety. The step-thru design makes it accessible for riders of all ages and abilities.",
